{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02927","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 狄仁杰","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宸晖降望金舆转，仙路峥嵘碧涧幽。\n羽杖遥临鸾鹤驾，帷宫直坐凤麟洲。\n飞泉洒液恒疑雨，密树含凉镇似秋。\n老臣预陪悬圃宴，余年方共赤松游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"狄仁杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}